  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Awards Papua New Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports Papua New Guinea (PNG) and Australian government objectives to increase the number of Papua New Guineans with tertiary qualifications and to fill human resource gaps in the country. The program offers long term scholarships for study in Australia and in PNG, as well as for short term professional development courses. It supports alumni linkages between Australia and PNG and institutional capacity building. The investment also covers the PNGAus Partnership Secondary Schools (PASS) initiative which sought to build educational and leadership capabilities and strengthen people-to-people links through partnering of 12 PNG with 12 Australian schools.</narrative>
  </description>
